error[E0611]: `?` inside an `errdefer` has nowhere to send its error
  --> mem:///main.lu:10:39
   |
10 |     errdefer print("errdefer {look(m, key(ok)?) else 0}")
   |     -------- the `errdefer` runs as `under` leaves
   |                                       ^^^^^^^^ this would leave `under` while `under` is already leaving
   |
   = note: a deferred expression runs while the function is leaving, so a second error has nowhere
     to go: handle it inside the `errdefer` with `else`, or move the fallible call out of the
     `errdefer` into the body.
